{title: I’ll be up again}

{comment: Chorus}
I’ll be up again, just you wait and see
Rough times won’t keep me down, they’ll just send me to my knees
Then while I’m in prayer, God will give the victory song
I’ll be up again where I belong

{comment: Bridge}
Rejoice not against me Oh mine enemy
When I fall I shall arise
Rejoice not against me Oh mine enemy
In the darkest night the Lord will be my light
